    "Prereticle.Custom ContextValueCD StatusOVL Status.Pilot CD.Pilot OVL.Pi splitflag.Pi splitcnt.",
    "筛选出满足Pi splitflag-Y且（PilotCD为Null或PilotOVL为Null的Context，即为需要自动Pirun的",
